      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Activating real-time defense with passive operation offers reduced but not negligible protection. In such a scenario, I'd optimize active modules for maximum efficiency focused on core endpoints. This would still require some level of system downtime or reduced complexity for certain functions, but it's aimed at preserving a degree of real-time threat detection capability. I will outline the possibility of a hybrid approach that might serve to meet your demands—though it will be essential to ensure this does not conflict with your organization's broader security policies. Shall I draft an outline of this hybrid solution for your review?",
      "source": "target",
